1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:03,225
Mimzi has a new red ball.

2
00:00:03,775 --> 00:00:05,802
Look at my bouncy ball!

3
00:00:05,802 --> 00:00:07,049
Boing, boing!

4
00:00:08,749 --> 00:00:11,999
Can I play with the ball too, Mimzi?

5
00:00:12,549 --> 00:00:14,724
No! It's mine!

6
00:00:15,274 --> 00:00:16,094
Oh no.

7
00:00:16,094 --> 00:00:17,824
Teddy feels sad.

8
00:00:19,974 --> 00:00:22,524
I just want to play.

9
00:00:23,324 --> 00:00:25,674
How do you think Teddy feels?

10
00:00:27,674 --> 00:00:29,774
Teddy feels sad.

11
00:00:31,474 --> 00:00:33,999
Mimzi thinks for a moment.

12
00:00:34,799 --> 00:00:38,173
Hmm. Playing alone is not much fun.

13
00:00:38,724 --> 00:00:41,599
Teddy, do you want to play with me?

14
00:00:43,299 --> 00:00:44,585
Yes, please!

15
00:00:44,585 --> 00:00:46,299
Thank you, Mimzi!

16
00:00:46,849 --> 00:00:49,924
Mimzi rolls the ball to Teddy.

17
00:00:50,174 --> 00:00:52,199
Roll, roll!

18
00:00:52,749 --> 00:00:55,649
And I roll it back to you!

19
00:00:57,349 --> 00:01:00,323
Taking turns is so much fun!

20
00:01:00,873 --> 00:01:03,923
Now Mimzi and Teddy are both happy.

21
00:01:06,923 --> 00:01:08,028
When we share,

22
00:01:08,028 --> 00:01:09,718
our friends feel happy,

23
00:01:09,718 --> 00:01:10,823
and we do too.

24
00:01:11,373 --> 00:01:13,573
Sharing is caring!

25
00:01:14,123 --> 00:01:16,473
Sharing is caring!

26
00:01:18,173 --> 00:01:19,948
Did you like the story?

27
00:01:19,948 --> 00:01:21,997
Let's remember it together!

28
00:01:22,547 --> 00:01:24,135
Do you remember?

29
00:01:24,135 --> 00:01:25,222
Let's see!

30
00:01:26,922 --> 00:01:28,797
What do we say?

31
00:01:30,997 --> 00:01:33,197
Sharing is caring!

32
00:01:33,747 --> 00:01:36,047
Yes! Well done!

33
00:01:37,747 --> 00:01:39,947
What did Mimzi have?

34
00:01:42,147 --> 00:01:44,246
A red ball!

35
00:01:44,796 --> 00:01:46,821
Great job!

36
00:01:48,521 --> 00:01:51,771
How did Teddy feel when Mimzi said no?

37
00:01:53,971 --> 00:01:55,421
Sad.

38
00:01:55,971 --> 00:01:57,946
You got it!

39
00:01:59,646 --> 00:02:01,771
What did Mimzi do?

40
00:02:03,971 --> 00:02:06,645
She shared her ball with Teddy!

41
00:02:07,195 --> 00:02:08,895
Super!

42
00:02:10,595 --> 00:02:13,245
How did they feel after sharing?

43
00:02:15,445 --> 00:02:16,944
Happy!

44
00:02:17,494 --> 00:02:19,144
Hooray!

45
00:02:20,844 --> 00:02:23,870
Wow! You remembered everything!

46
00:02:25,720 --> 00:02:28,370
You are a super learner!

47
00:02:30,070 --> 00:02:32,870
Great job, little learner!

48
00:02:33,420 --> 00:02:35,371
Share Mimzi with a friend,

49
00:02:35,371 --> 00:02:37,995
and subscribe for more learning fun!

50
00:02:38,545 --> 00:02:39,626
Next time,

51
00:02:39,626 --> 00:02:41,870
watch me brush my teeth.

52
00:02:42,120 --> 00:02:43,846
Bye bye!
